<p>Russian forces launched a large overnight wave of drones and missiles across Ukraine, killing at least five people and damaging sites in several regions on Saturday, Ukrainian officials said. President Volodymyr Zelensky said the main target was energy infrastructure outside Kyiv, while authorities also reported casualties in the Kyiv region and in Zaporizhzhia. The strikes came as fighting continued on both sides of the border. Ukraine also said it struck a port and an oil refinery in Russia’s Krasnodar region, according to RFE/RL.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/dt3sz_R-s4VJeD8geC_4Vx8pq-gdd_ns9ezEJ-deX1U9YFOEC-BVk6oLwDD1INJWe_d0Cp8XcPvSv7ixeKbYs9fcUUQ1NLmtN2GT2f0bm43z' alt='A Ukrainian law enforcement officer walks amid debris in the courtyard of a damaged residential building following an air attack in Zaporizhzhia on March 14, 2026, amid the Russian invasion of Ukraine.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Geographic spread: Zelensky said the overnight barrage also hit the Sumy, Kharkiv, Dnipro and Mykolaiv regions, showing the attack reached far beyond the capital area.</li><li>Kyiv-region footprint: Officials said the attack struck four districts in the Kyiv region, suggesting damage across several communities rather than at a single site.</li><li>Zaporizhzhia toll: Governor Ivan Fedorov said guided bombs hit a residential area of Zaporizhzhia city, killing one person and injuring three.</li></ul><blockquote>Russia will try to exploit the war in the Middle East to cause even greater destruction here in Europe, in Ukraine - Volodymyr Zelensky</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Volodymyr Zelensky: Zelensky renewed his call for partners to increase production of air-defense weapons, saying Kyiv’s stocks are running low under continued Russian strikes. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1982256/five-killed-in-russian-air-attacks-on-ukraine'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Ukrainian police: Police said Russian forces kept striking the Kyiv region, underscoring sustained pressure around the capital even as peace talks remained stalled. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/ukraine-says-russian-strikes-kill-many-in-kyiv-region/article70742527.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1982256/five-killed-in-russian-air-attacks-on-ukraine'>Five killed in Russian air attacks on Ukraine</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rferl.org/a/ukraine-russia-war-drone-missile-attack-iran/33706687.html'>Russian Air Strikes Kill 6 In Ukraine, As Kyiv Pounds Oil Refinery In Krasnodar</a> - rferl.org</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/ukraine-says-russian-strikes-kill-many-in-kyiv-region/article70742527.ece'>Russian strike on Kyiv region kills 4, wounds at least 15, with peace talks stalled</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/russian-missile-drone-strike-kyiv-region-deaths-injuries/'>Russian strike on Kyiv region kills at least 6 people and wounds dozens</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reuters.com/world/four-killed-russian-air-attack-kyiv-region-officials-say-2026-03-14/'>Five people are killed and three others are injured in Russian drone strikes on residential areas and critical infrastructure across Ukraine.</a> - reuters.com</li></ul>